ent-AppraisalTool = 評估工具 | appraisal tool
    .desc = 這是會計人員的最佳夥伴，不僅與銀河市場有著量子連結，還能評估甚至是最棘手的物品。它還會告訴你，某個貨箱裡是否裝有已完成的懸賞目標。 | A beancounter's best friend, with a quantum connection to the galactic market and the ability to appraise even the toughest items. It will also tell you if a crate contains a completed bounty.
